[10084]="70027340\n1\tTalk to Halbarad in Tûr Morva\030Talk to Radanir in Tûr Morva\030Talk to Braigiar in Tûr Morva\tHalbarad, Radanir, and Braigiar can be found throughout Tûr Morva. Penrod wants you to check on with members of the Grey Company helping the Falcon-clan prepare for war with Saruman.\n2\tTalk to Penrod in Tûr Morva\tPenrod is among the northern buildings of Tûr Morva. You have spoken with a number of Rangers and found how they are helping with the preparations.\n",
[10085]="70022D7C\n1\tTalk to Calenglad in Tinnudir\tTinnudir lay on the eastern bank of Lake Evendim, a massive lake in the shadow of the Blue Mountains. Calenglad is surely stationed somewhere in the camp there. Calenglad sent a message inviting you to speak with him at Tinnudir.\n",
